---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { ArrowLeft, Copy, Download, Plus } from '@lucide/astro';
---
<Base title="Init: design your content and forms" description="Describe a content model to your agent, edit typed fields and repeating groups, test a conditional form, and export a compatible EmDash seed with a portable model.">
 <a class="model-return" href="/init"><ArrowLeft size={16} aria-hidden="true"/>App configuration</a>
 <div class="model-heading"><h1>Make the fields<br/>fit the work.</h1><p class="lede">A workshop listing, a client project, a community directory. Describe what people need to edit, then give it structure. Your agent implements the application around that model.</p></div>
 <details class="model-brief"><summary>Start by describing what you want</summary><label>Your form or content brief<textarea data-model-brief maxlength="2000" placeholder="A community workshop listing with a name, format, joining link for online sessions and a repeatable materials list."></textarea></label><button type="button" class="secondary" data-copy-model-request disabled><Copy size={16} aria-hidden="true"/>Copy field-design request</button><pre data-model-design-request hidden tabindex="0"></pre><p class="small">Give the request to your agent. It returns the supported model JSON; import that file below. No AI account or paid API is connected by this page. Use fictional examples rather than private client records.</p></details>
 <div class="model-toolbar"><label>Import a model<input type="file" accept="application/json,.json" data-model-import disabled/></label><div class="actions"><button type="button" class="secondary" data-model-save disabled>Save draft on this device</button><button type="button" class="secondary" data-model-reset disabled>Start from the example</button></div></div>
 <p data-model-message role="status" aria-live="polite" class="message">The editor runs on this device. It never changes your CMS or publishes content.</p>
 <div class="model-workspace"><section aria-labelledby="model-structure-heading"><h2 id="model-structure-heading">Content structure</h2><form data-model-editor><div class="model-identity"><label>Collection label<input data-model-label maxlength="80" value="Community workshops" required/></label><label>Collection name<input data-model-collection maxlength="48" value="workshops" required aria-describedby="collection-name-help"/></label></div><p id="collection-name-help" class="small">A stable lowercase name in EmDash. Changing an existing name needs a migration review.</p><label>Field groups, one per line<textarea data-model-groups rows="2">The workshop
Useful details</textarea></label><div data-model-fields></div><button type="button" class="secondary" data-model-add-field disabled><Plus size={16} aria-hidden="true"/>Add a field</button></form></section>
 <aside><div class="model-preview-heading"><h2>Try the form</h2><p class="small" data-model-preview-state>Sample entries stay in this page. Change Format to see the joining link appear.</p></div><form data-model-preview novalidate><div data-model-form></div><button type="submit" disabled data-model-test>Check sample entry</button></form><p class="small" data-model-values-message role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><details><summary>Validated sample values</summary><pre data-model-values>No sample checked.</pre></details>
 <section class="model-export"><h2>Take the structure with you.</h2><p>The model carries field groups and optional display conditions. The seed creates compatible EmDash CMS fields; native EmDash admin does not apply these frontend conditions.</p><div class="actions"><button type="button" data-model-copy disabled><Copy size={16} aria-hidden="true"/>Copy to agent</button><button type="button" class="secondary" data-model-download disabled><Download size={16} aria-hidden="true"/>Download model</button><button type="button" class="secondary" data-seed-download disabled>Download EmDash seed</button></div><details><summary>Inspect the model and CMS seed</summary><pre data-model-output></pre><pre data-seed-output></pre></details><details><summary>Read the implementation handoff</summary><pre data-model-prompt></pre></details><p class="small">Your agent reviews the existing schema, permissions, data and app source before applying anything. A field preview is not a deployed application or approval to overwrite a CMS.</p></section></aside></div>
 <section class="model-scope"><h2>Useful constraints beat broken forms.</h2><p>This first editor supports short and long text, HTTPS links, whole numbers, Yes / no, choices and repeating groups. Repeaters contain up to six scalar fields and cannot nest, matching the current EmDash implementation. Groups and optional conditions belong to the generated app form; required conditional fields need a reviewed server implementation.</p><p><a href="/architecture#init">How this fits Init</a> · <a href="https://docs.emdashcms.com/reference/field-types/">Official EmDash field types</a> · <a href="https://github.com/loftwah/app-composer/tree/main/lib/content-model">Reusable model implementation</a></p></section>
 <noscript><p>This local field editor needs JavaScript. Your agent can use the reusable model library directly. Public app examples remain available without JavaScript.</p></noscript>
 <script src="../../lib/content-model-client.ts"></script>
</Base>
<style>
 .model-return{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;min-height:44px;font-size:14px}.model-heading{max-width:860px}.model-heading h1{font-size:3rem;max-width:24ch;margin-top:18px}.model-heading .lede{font-size:1.1rem;max-width:68ch}.model-brief{border-block:1px solid var(--color-border);padding:10px 0;margin:28px 0}.model-toolbar{display:flex;gap:32px;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between}.model-toolbar>label{flex:1;max-width:480px}.model-toolbar .actions{margin:18px 0;gap:12px}.model-toolbar button{font-size:14px}.model-workspace{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.1fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:48px;align-items:start}.model-workspace h2{font-size:1.65rem;max-width:none;margin:0 0 18px}.model-identity{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px}.model-workspace textarea{min-height:80px}.model-workspace aside{min-width:0}.model-preview-heading{border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-border);padding-bottom:12px;margin-bottom:24px}.model-export{padding-top:24px;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border);margin-top:28px}.model-export p{font-size:14px;color:var(--color-muted)}.model-export .actions{gap:12px}.model-export button{font-size:14px;padding:10px 16px}.model-scope{border-top:1px solid var(--color-border);margin-top:48px;padding-top:32px}.model-scope h2{font-size:1.8rem}.model-scope p{max-width:90ch;color:var(--color-muted);font-size:14px}
 @media(max-width:950px){.model-workspace{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:40px}.model-toolbar{display:block}.model-heading h1{font-size:2.4rem}}
 @media(max-width:500px){.model-identity{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:0}.model-toolbar .actions{align-items:stretch}.model-toolbar button{flex:1}}
</style>
<style is:global>
 .model-field{border-block:1px solid var(--color-border);margin:16px 0;padding:0 0 18px}.model-field>summary{font-size:15px;display:list-item}.model-field .field-kind{font-size:12px;color:var(--color-muted);font-weight:400;margin-left:8px}.model-field-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:0 16px}.model-field-grid>label{font-size:14px;margin:12px 0}.model-field input,.model-field select,.model-field textarea{font-size:14px;padding:10px}.model-check{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;font-size:14px;min-height:44px}.model-check input{width:18px;height:18px;margin:0;flex-shrink:0}.model-field-actions{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:16px}.model-field-actions button,.model-repeater-actions button{font-size:13px;min-height:44px;padding:8px 12px}.model-sub-fields{border-top:1px solid var(--color-border);padding-top:18px}.model-sub-fields h3{font-size:1.1rem;margin:0 0 14px}.model-sub-field{border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-border);padding:12px 0}.model-condition{margin-top:16px}.model-condition summary{font-size:14px}.model-repeater-actions{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:12px 0}.model-row legend{font-size:14px}.model-row{padding:16px;margin:18px 0}.model-row>label{font-size:14px}.model-preview-group{padding:20px;margin:20px 0}.model-preview-group>legend{font-size:15px}.model-preview-group>label{font-size:14px}.model-required{font-size:12px;color:var(--color-muted)}@media(max-width:500px){.model-field-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
